WEBVTT

00:03:29.121 --> 00:03:31.290
Audience: We’re not so ancient!

00:03:31.332 --> 00:03:32.500
MB: No, I know.

00:03:33.459 --> 00:03:35.753
You don't have to be old
to be married 40 years,

00:03:35.753 --> 00:03:37.964
some people get married
when they're, like, 20.

00:03:38.005 --> 00:03:39.131
Not me.

00:03:39.173 --> 00:03:40.299
(Laughter)

00:03:41.384 --> 00:03:45.096
I do understand why, like,
baby boomers are sort of afraid

00:03:45.096 --> 00:03:47.431
now that millennials
are getting older, you know,

00:03:47.431 --> 00:03:49.684
now that we're getting
real jobs, I do get that.

00:03:49.725 --> 00:03:53.104
You know, it's hard to imagine
a millennial in a serious job, right?

00:03:53.145 --> 00:03:55.481
Can you imagine a millennial as a doctor?

00:03:55.481 --> 00:03:56.649
You know?

00:03:56.941 --> 00:03:59.860
Like, "Not to be a bitch,
but you have cancer."

00:03:59.902 --> 00:04:04.365
(Laughter)